      ],
      "is_risk": false,
      "conviction": "medium",
      "raw_mention": "$ACMR",
      "text": "I’m just finding new ideas. As for $ACMR up to you. It’s just my example on what I’m trying to look for, since it’s has around ~$18.2B worth of assets from ACMR China. And it’s currently trades at a $7.3B MC.\n\nI don’t think they can fully liquidate it, which is why it trades discount to nav.\n\nBut that’s also why standalone ai vertical is important, think their us parent expansion takes off in h2 2026.\n\nI just think these type of companies are slightly more derisked since of assets they own",
